#. module: account_move_template
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_move_template.account_move_template_form
msgid ""
"Check to issue the document to the run's third party, when it names one, "
"instead of the partner the operation is about"
msgstr ""
"Active para emitir el documento al tercero de la ejecución, cuando indica "
"uno, en lugar del contacto de quien trata la operación"

#. module: account_move_template
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_template.field_account_move_template__use_third_party
msgid ""
"If checked, the generated document is issued to the run's third party when "
"it names one -- the party a document is made out to in place of the partner,"
" such as the generic public for a customer who takes no fiscal invoice -- "
"instead of the partner the operation is about. Leave it off wherever the "
"partner himself has to be on the document: the credit note that reduces his "
"debt is one of those."
msgstr ""
"Si se activa, el documento generado se emite al tercero de la ejecución "
"cuando esta indica uno -- a quien se emite un documento en lugar del "
"contacto, como el público en general para un cliente que no pide factura "
"fiscal -- en lugar del contacto de quien trata la operación. Déjelo "
"desactivado donde el propio contacto debe aparecer en el documento: la nota "
"de crédito que reduce su deuda es uno de esos casos."

#. module: account_move_template
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_move_template.field_account_move_template__use_third_party
msgid "Issue to the Third Party"
msgstr "Emitir al tercero"

#. module: account_move_template
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_move_template.account_move_template_run_form
msgid "Leave empty to issue to the partner"
msgstr "Deje vacío para emitir al contacto"

#. module: account_move_template
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_move_template.account_move_template_run_form
msgid "Optional: the party this entry is made out to in place of the partner"
msgstr "Opcional: a quien se emite este asiento en lugar del contacto"

#. module: account_move_template
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_template.field_wizard_account_move_template_create_move__third_party_id
msgid ""
"The party a document is made out to in place of the partner, such as the "
"generic public for a customer who takes no fiscal invoice. Informational by "
"default: partner_id stays on the generated document (task t22217). Only a "
"template that ticks 'Issue to the Third Party' is issued to this one "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"A quien se emite un documento en lugar del contacto, como el público en "
"general para un cliente que no pide factura fiscal. Informativo por defecto:"
" partner_id permanece en el documento generado (tarea t22217). Solo una "
"plantilla que activa 'Emitir al tercero' se emite a este."

#. module: account_move_template
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_move_template.field_wizard_account_move_template_create_move__third_party_id
msgid "Third Party"
msgstr "Tercero"
